1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,280
No enemy…

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,621
No walls…

3
00:00:12,481 --> 00:00:13,681
There is you…

4
00:00:14,321 --> 00:00:23,741
And inside - we all…

5
00:00:26,242 --> 00:00:28,662
Shadows argue with fire in glass,

6
00:00:29,302 --> 00:00:31,982
Everything blends in a single mass.

7
00:00:32,542 --> 00:00:35,262
Pain and joy - just two tight strings,

8
00:00:35,862 --> 00:00:38,662
Heart still beats, but without wars or kings.

9
00:00:39,202 --> 00:00:42,043
Meanings fall like quiet rain,

10
00:00:42,543 --> 00:00:45,383
Hear each sound - don’t rush the gain.

11
00:00:45,843 --> 00:00:48,703
No such thing as “foe” or “kin”,

12
00:00:49,283 --> 00:00:52,043
One whole world in a stream of skin.

13
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:56,243
Extremes dissolve into smoke,

14
00:00:56,684 --> 00:00:59,504
Truth moves where the edges broke.

15
00:00:59,604 --> 00:01:02,804
Cold flame whispers, soft and slow:

16
00:01:02,924 --> 00:01:06,004
No division - only the call below.

17
00:01:06,244 --> 00:01:09,524
Zeroing - a clean new move,

18
00:01:09,584 --> 00:01:12,524
No guilt to carry, nothing to prove.

19
00:01:12,945 --> 00:01:16,265
No enemies, no walls, no “us”,

20
00:01:16,385 --> 00:01:19,365
Only rhythm pulling through the dust.

21
00:01:19,545 --> 00:01:22,665
Zeroing - a newborn beat,

22
00:01:23,285 --> 00:01:26,085
Light and shadow sound complete.

23
00:01:26,265 --> 00:01:34,206
The world’s not split, not torn in two,

24
00:01:34,866 --> 00:01:43,346
Like a breath - intense and true.

25
00:01:46,387 --> 00:01:48,687
All the poles - an old disguise,

26
00:01:49,147 --> 00:01:52,067
Sense lives deeper than form or signs.

27
00:01:52,307 --> 00:01:55,427
The voice is silent, yet strings still sound,

28
00:01:55,707 --> 00:01:58,727
Where there’s no choice - the real is found.

29
00:01:59,027 --> 00:02:01,988
The wind delivers a single phrase:

30
00:02:02,008 --> 00:02:05,228
“The whole world’s a circle, not a trace.”

31
00:02:05,888 --> 00:02:08,728
Let duality play its role,

32
00:02:09,008 --> 00:02:12,088
But in its zero sleeps our soul.

33
00:02:13,268 --> 00:02:15,948
Silence isn’t end, it’s start,

34
00:02:16,068 --> 00:02:19,249
The world breathes deep in the hidden chart.

35
00:02:19,749 --> 00:02:22,649
All contrasts leave a single thread,

36
00:02:22,709 --> 00:02:25,989
Where choice once lived - now only light is spread.

37
00:02:26,249 --> 00:02:29,389
Zeroing - in the pulse of veins,

38
00:02:29,429 --> 00:02:32,649
What I divided, I now release.

39
00:02:33,330 --> 00:02:36,150
No below, no above, no frames,

40
00:02:36,370 --> 00:02:39,370
One world only - no staged remains.

41
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:42,970
I split it once: good and pain,

42
00:02:43,350 --> 00:02:46,270
“Us” and “them” in separate lanes.

43
00:02:46,690 --> 00:02:51,251
Now I see - it’s always one,

44
00:02:51,411 --> 00:03:04,071
In every “no”, a “yes” begun.

45
00:03:06,112 --> 00:03:09,392
Light and shadow aren’t enemies - just steps,

46
00:03:09,672 --> 00:03:11,712
Every tone in a zigzag depth.

47
00:03:12,572 --> 00:03:15,132
Don’t divide into dark and bright,

48
00:03:15,952 --> 00:03:19,012
Everything flows - that’s the insight.

49
00:03:19,152 --> 00:03:21,853
Silence brings the sound back home,

50
00:03:22,313 --> 00:03:25,113
The circle closes - moves alone.

51
00:03:25,673 --> 00:03:28,493
Zeroing isn’t rest or sleep,

52
00:03:28,893 --> 00:03:32,013
It’s an endless rhythm the soul must keep.

53
00:03:34,533 --> 00:03:36,113
I am not alone.

54
00:03:41,174 --> 00:03:44,594
I am not the other.

55
00:03:45,694 --> 00:03:48,154
I am all.

56
00:03:49,254 --> 00:03:52,754
I am still.

